		// --- java.net.URI SSRF (CWE-918) ---
		// PR-CATjava (Fix 4): relabel from SnkFileWrite/CWE-22 to
		// SnkURLFetch/CWE-918. `new URI(tainted)` is overwhelmingly
		// followed by HttpClient.send / RestTemplate.exchange /
		// WebClient.get — i.e. SSRF, not path traversal. The CWE-22
		// path-traversal shape is still caught when the URI value
