		// --- Apache Camel ProducerTemplate SSRF / protocol smuggling (CWE-918) ---
		// ProducerTemplate.sendBody/requestBody dispatch a payload to a Camel
		// endpoint identified by a URI string. The URI scheme picks the
		// transport: http:/https:/jetty:/netty4-http: are HTTP requests
		// (SSRF), exec: shells out (command injection), jdbc: opens a database
		// connection (SQL injection), bean:/class: invoke arbitrary Java,
		// file:/ftp: read or write files. Tainted input flowing into args[0]
